core": 13, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8955279, "raw_content": "Look, I know some things are expensive like ground beef. But even that, you can find deals. I found ground beef for $2.74 per pound with a deal at Walmart. You have to look around.\n\nDrudge Report has a headline about people saying they can't afford Thanksgiving dinner.\n\nAll over Houston, there were turkeys in stores at 50 cents per pound, and many with free potatoes, stuffing mix, cranberries, loaf of bread, etc. with the purchase of a turkey. \n\nThere was a deal at Kroger for 10 LBS of sweet potatoes for $1.\n\nThere were ads all over the place and even fliers delivered to my mailbox - come to __________ to get a free turkey.\n\n50 cents per pound is a 16 LB turkey for $8 and a 25 LB turkey for $12.50. \n\nThere were all sorts of deals to make Thanksgiving dinner food not only affordable, but down right dirt cheap.\n\nAldi still today has a complete Thanksgiving deal of \"under $38 for a family Thanksgiving Dinner\". The turkey, sweet potatoes, stuffing,. bread, cranberries, carrots, celery, pie ingredients - on their list it's $25. It's a 16 LB turkey, which feeds 10-12 adults. Have more people? OK, add another turkey for $11.50. Double everything: $50 to feed 12 adults and 12 children with lots of leftovers. That's a little more than $2 per person. It's affordable. It's dirt cheap.\n\nThe leftist media is even pushing unaffordable travel due to gas prices as the price of oil and gas keeps falling.\n\nThis false narrative will continue until the microsecond the last breath of acknowledgement escapes the last leftist sworn into office in January. Then the media will start with \"lower prices\" and \"relief\" even as the leftists push their massive tax increases.", "author": "conservativefrank", "created": 1795644653330, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "SHILL_DETECTOR", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "The Leftist Media Still Pushing Fake High Prices", "last_comment_created": 1795646665312, "content": "<p>Look, I know some things are expensive like ground beef. But even that, you can find deals. I found ground beef for $2.74 per pound with a deal at Walmart. You have to look around.</p>\n<p>Drudge Report has a headline about people saying they can't afford Thanksgiving dinner.</p>\n<p>All over Houston, there were turkeys in stores at 50 cents per pound, and many with free potatoes, stuffing mix, cranberries, loaf of bread, etc. with the purchase of a turkey.</p>\n<p>There was a deal at Kroger for 10 LBS of sweet potatoes for $1.</p>\n<p>There were ads all over the place and even fliers delivered to my mailbox - come to __________ to get a free turkey.</p>\n<p>50 cents per pound is a 16 LB turkey for $8 and a 25 LB turkey for $12.50.</p>\n<p>There were all sorts of deals to make Thanksgiving dinner food not only affordable, but down right dirt cheap.</p>\n<p>Aldi still today has a complete Thanksgiving deal of &quot;under $38 for a family Thanksgiving Dinner&quot;. The turkey, sweet potatoes, stuffing,. bread, cranberries, carrots, celery, pie ingredients - on their list it's $25. It's a 16 LB turkey, which feeds 10-12 adults. Have more people? OK, add another turkey for $11.50. Double everything: $50 to feed 12 adults and 12 children with lots of leftovers. That's a little more than $2 per person. It's affordable. It's dirt cheap.</p>\n<p>The leftist media is even pushing unaffordable travel due to gas prices as the price of oil and gas keeps falling.</p>\n<p>This false narrative will continue until the microsecond the last breath of acknowledgement escapes the last leftist sworn into office in January. Then the media will start with &quot;lower prices&quot; and &quot;relief&quot; even as the leftists push their massive tax increases.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 6, "score_up": 13, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATon2hgzX", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 36, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "fight", "id": 8954897, "raw_content": "", "author": "Flowers-By-Irene", "created": 1795624601321, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "cyberrigger", "is_video": true, "video_link": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/TrN5Cu1Z-Pw?start=0", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "www.youtube.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://www.youtube.com/shorts/TrN5Cu1Z-Pw?feature=share", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Texans are PUSHING BACK on isl@m. #texas #jeffsquare #shorts", "last_comment_created": 1795634843610, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 3, "score_up": 36, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "FIGHT,\u00a0\u00a0FIGHT,\u00a0\u00a0FIGHT!", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2125405023018398037", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATon2hgWZ", "is_twitter": true, "is_admin": false, "score": 43, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8954823, "raw_content": "", "author": "Trick", "crea